<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVAN LEU EDGES UP TO 4.5635 PER DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVAN LEU EDGES UP TO 4.5635 PER DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to</p>
<p>4.5635 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange</p>
<p>from 4.5640 on July 18.</p>
<p>				   July 21    July 18</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.5635     4.5640</p>
<p> volume traded ()	   300,000    700,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
